    <string name="bulk_step_fill">2. Fill in your products</string>
    <string name="bulk_fill_help">One product per row. Keep the column headings. Product name, Stock unit, and Selling price are required. Prices are pesos per stock unit. Optional costs, stock, and reminders default to 0. Keep barcodes as text to preserve leading zeros. Use decimal points, no currency signs or thousands separators. Up to 1,000 rows, 8 MB. Excel files must be .xlsx; CSV must use UTF-8.</string>
    <string name="bulk_units_help">Allow fractions: Yes or No. For each optional selling unit, enter its name, the number of stock units inside, and its full selling price. Example: Pack, 12, 118. Blank selling-unit groups are ignored. New categories and unit names become reusable.</string>
